<title>FINLAND: NESTE IN WIND ENERGY DEAL WITH REVON SAHKO.</title>
<headline>NESTE IN WIND ENERGY DEAL WITH REVON SAHKO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish oil, chemicals and energy group Neste Oy said on Friday it will build two wind-generated power plants supplying about 2,200 megawatt hours (MWh) of electricity per year to local distributor Revon Sahko.</p>
<p>The facilities, Finland's first 600 kW wind-power plants, will be delivered by Neste's Advance Power Systems (NAPS) unit, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
